          "Record rejected and deferred requests as well as approvals. A role change should trigger a review of queue access. Approval, payment, records disposition, and policy exceptions stay with the named owner. Name the backup owner and the coverage window in advance. The {topic} case note should show what the title production system held at the time and who reviewed it.",
          "Name the owner for every open item, including items waiting on someone else. The record should show the source, the decision, and the surviving value in one place. Write the authority limit into the case template. Keep the original request so a later correction does not erase the reason for the work. For {topic}, compare CPL request with the destination value rather than relying on a status label."
