          "Log the handoff time when a case crosses a shift. Do not let a deadline expand a role beyond its written limit. The next reviewer should not have to ask which document is authoritative. The record should show the source, the decision, and the surviving value in one place. In the {topic} queue, an item without a next action is treated as an exception.",
          "A short written rule is easier to test than an unwritten habit. If the team cannot reproduce the result from the record, the control is not finished. Open the day with a queue pass by age, owner, and missing evidence. A case with no next action is an exception even if it says in progress. For {topic}, the working file keeps CPL request and underwriter instructions beside the decision note."
