          "A case that moves between owners should keep both owner periods visible. A short written rule is easier to test than an unwritten habit. Do not let a deadline expand a role beyond its written limit. Check whether the exception came from a form, a rule, or a permission. A {topic} exception keeps issuance confirmation attached and routes the question to the title officer."
