          "Link the evidence to the exact field it supports. Name the owner and the date beside each decision. Avoid a private second version in a personal document. Name the owner for every open item, including items waiting on someone else. For {topic}, the working file keeps CPL request and underwriter instructions beside the decision note.",
          "Archive the extract with the study so it can be repeated. A short written rule is easier to test than an unwritten habit. A clean-looking status is not evidence that the underlying work is correct. Do not store credentials or unnecessary personal data in the case. Every {topic} handoff names the title officer and the field in the title production system that will confirm the change."
